     "body": "<p>This has already been implemented--. Verification steps:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -i -X POST http://localhost:8080/rest/\r\n# returns new resource's URI: http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15\r\n\r\n# HEAD to follow the Link rel=\"acl\" location\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -I http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15\r\n\r\n# create the ACL to the testuser can only append to the container\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X PUT http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15/fcr:acl -H 'Content-Type: text/turtle' --data-binary @- &lt;&lt;END\r\n@prefix acl: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#&gt;.\r\n&lt;#auth&gt; a acl:Authorization;\r\nacl:agent \"testuser\";\r\nacl:accessTo &lt;/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15&gt;;\r\nacl:mode acl:Append .\r\nEND\r\n\r\ncurl -u testuser:testpass http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15\r\n# --&gt; 403 (cannot read the container)\r\n\r\ncurl -u testuser:testpass http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15 -X POST\r\n# --&gt; 201 (can create a child resource)\r\n\r\ncurl -u testuser:testpass http://localhost:8080/rest/ff4f80f3-70f3-4292-9a1e-ef03c4d0df15/a477dd32-da66-42e1-83f8-8f227f889897 -X POST\r\n# --&gt; 201 (can create a child resource of a child resource) </pre>\n</div></div>",
